            "text": "<h3>“I am so thankful for this program! I started it because I needed to make some changes in my life since I was having some of the same health problems my mother had…. So many things I already knew and had ignored for years. Now I’m on a healthy path and am amazed by how quickly my body has adjusted to the changes, as well the pounds I’ve shed and how energized I feel.”</h3><p><em><strong>- Terri, Food Matters Nutrition Certification Program Graduate</strong></em></p>"
          }
        }
      },
